<title>JAPAN: Token plans share split.</title>
<headline>Token plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Token Corp Ltd said on Monday it planned a 1.2-for-1 share split on August 20, for shareholders as of June 30.</p>
</text>
